<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Adjacency-list recovery averages on <span id="S5.T5.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">12AngryMen</span>. Best F1 per act and overall are bolded. CoT instructions consistently improve graph recovery. Models perform better on the short Act 3.</figcaption>
