<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 9: </span>Summary of the 12AngryMen dataset. All three acts contain convergent structures (<em id="A2.T9.4" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">fan-in</em>), where multiple arguments attack or support the same claim.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A2.T10" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A2.T10.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A2.T10.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T10.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt"><span id="A2.T10.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Property</span></th>
<td id="A2.T10.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_tt"><span id="A2.T10.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Value</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T10.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T10.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t"># Graphs</th>
